      "start": 568.534,
      "end": 570.454,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 571.613,
      "end": 573.657,
      "text": "So what happened with peezy b?"
    },
    {
      "start": 573.658,
      "end": 576.286,
      "text": "Well, I slapped him with his grapes."
    },
    {
      "start": 576.287,
      "end": 579.182,
      "text": "- Yeah? Love it. - And I thumped him on his head."
    },
    {
      "start": 579.183,
      "end": 582.429,
      "text": "And then I dropped his phone in his fish tank and he hired me to be his assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 582.43,
      "end": 585.383,
      "text": "Yeah baby! That is..."
    },
    {
      "start": 585.384,
      "end": 588.953,
      "text": "- Wait, who did what now? - I know, it's crazy, right?"
    },
    {
      "start": 588.954,
      "end": 592.537,
      "text": "Peezy thought I was cool, duh."
    },
    {
      "start": 592.538,
      "end": 595.427,
      "text": "And he needed an assistant so..."
    },
    {
      "start": 595.428,
      "end": 598.588,
      "text": "But peezy b was mean to me."
    },
    {
      "start": 598.589,
      "end": 603.509,
      "text": "He made fun of my hat that says \"hat\" on it."
    },
    {
      "start": 603.97,
      "end": 607.15,
      "text": "It's not a great hat."
    },
    {
      "start": 607.173,
      "end": 610.775,
      "text": "So how are you gonna babysit here with me and be peezy b's assistant?"
    },
    {
      "start": 610.776,
      "end": 613.244,
      "text": "Look, I don't know. But we'll figure it out."
    },
    {
      "start": 613.245,
      "end": 615.213,
      "text": "I'm here right now, right? Here I am."
    },
    {
      "start": 615.214,
      "end": 617.248,
      "text": "Yeah. Maybe it could work."
    },
    {
      "start": 617.249,
      "end": 620.429,
      "text": "Ooh."
    },
    {
      "start": 621.553,
      "end": 623.368,
      "text": "Gotta roll."
    },
    {
      "start": 623.369,
      "end": 625.764,
      "text": "- Wait! Wait! What?! - I gotta go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 625.765,
      "end": 631.163,
      "text": "Peezy wants a tricycle, a kosher salami, and some Mexican lip stick."
    },
    {
      "start": 631.164,
      "end": 633.265,
      "text": "- But you can't leave! - Dude, I..."
    },
    {
      "start": 633.266,
      "end": 635.834,
      "text": "You promised you'd babysit here with me tonight!"
    },
    {
      "start": 635.835,
      "end": 639.188,
      "text": "Hey, remember what you said to me this morning?"
    },
    {
      "start": 639.189,
      "end": 643.241,
      "text": "Yeah. I told you to stop leaving little hairs on our soap."
    },
    {
      "start": 643.242,
      "end": 647.278,
      "text": "After that, when you wanted to go to your cool audition?"
    },
    {
      "start": 647.279,
      "end": 651.916,
      "text": "You said that if I was a good friend I should be happy for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 651.917,
      "end": 655.86,
      "text": "Oh, come on! Peezy said I'd get to learn all about the music business..."
    },
    {
      "start": 655.861,
      "end": 658.923,
      "text": "And I get to meet big celebrities."
    },
    {
      "start": 658.924,
      "end": 660.343,
      "text": "But hey..."
    },
    {
      "start": 660.344,
      "end": 664.253,
      "text": "If you want me to quit, and stay here, and help you babysit..."
    },
    {
      "start": 664.254,
      "end": 668.045,
      "text": "You just say so, and that's what I'll do."
    },
    {
      "start": 668.046,
      "end": 672.529,
      "text": "I want you to quit and stay here and help me babysit."
    },
    {
      "start": 672.53,
      "end": 674.45,
      "text": "Pfft."
    },
    {
      "start": 674.672,
      "end": 676.592,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 680.976,
      "end": 684.276,
      "text": "I got swaggy spunk! Woo!"
    },
    {
      "start": 684.711,
      "end": 686.121,
      "text": "Hey!"
    },
    {
      "start": 686.122,
      "end": 688.845,
      "text": "What's this hard hair ball?"
    },
    {
      "start": 688.846,
      "end": 691.606,
      "text": "That's our soap!"
    },
    {
      "start": 698.667,
      "end": 699.968,
      "text": "Turn me up!"
    },
    {
      "start": 699.969,
      "end": 702.011,
      "text": "You hear me, Puckett? Let's go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 702.012,
      "end": 705.039,
      "text": "♪ Uh, you living' a lie."
    },
    {
      "start": 705.04,
      "end": 706.741,
      "text": "♪ No rib in the sky."
    },
    {
      "start": 706.742,
      "end": 708.509,
      "text": "♪ Love in the air."
    },
    {
      "start": 708.51,
      "end": 710.811,
      "text": "♪ You feel that Karma?"
    },
    {
      "start": 710.812,
      "end": 714.515,
      "text": "♪ Drama mama. Talking to llamas."
    },
    {
      "start": 714.516,
      "end": 718.078,
      "text": "♪ I go and fly to The Bahamas!"
    },
    {
      "start": 718.079,
      "end": 719.939,
      "text": "Woo!"
    },
    {
      "start": 720.003,
      "end": 722.095,
      "text": "- Let's do this! Ready? - Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 722.096,
      "end": 724.796,
      "text": "- Pull! - Shoot!"
    },
    {
      "start": 725.872,
      "end": 727.531,
      "text": "- Woo! - Nice!"
    },
    {
      "start": 727.532,
      "end": 728.701,
      "text": "Boys!"
    },
    {
      "start": 728.702,
      "end": 731.731,
      "text": "An apartment is no place for archery!"
    },
    {
      "start": 731.732,
      "end": 733.383,
      "text": "We do what we want!"
    },
    {
      "start": 733.384,
      "end": 735.647,
      "text": "Yeah, well you just wait 'til Sam gets here!"
    },
    {
      "start": 735.648,
      "end": 737.575,
      "text": "- Because you're gonna be sorry... - Cat? Cat?"
    },
    {
      "start": 737.576,
      "end": 739.558,
      "text": "- Sam? - Yeah. What you need?"
    },
    {
      "start": 739.559,
      "end": 743.343,
      "text": "- You said you'd be home by dinner time! - I know. I know, but uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 743.344,
      "end": 745.177,
      "text": "♪ Running' through my memory..."
    },
    {
      "start": 745.178,
      "end": 747.696,
      "text": "- I'm gonna be a little late. - Late?"
    },
    {
      "start": 747.697,
      "end": 749.798,
      "text": "That's the fourth time this week you've been late!"
    },
    {
      "start": 749.799,
      "end": 752.801,
      "text": "- Hey, put that down! - Eat garbage!"
    },
    {
      "start": 752.802,
      "end": 756.772,
      "text": "Cat, I'm sorry, but peezy wanted me to stay and hear his new song."
    },
    {
      "start": 756.773,
      "end": 759.751,
      "text": "Well, I want you to come home and help me babysit!"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.704,
      "end": 764.448,
      "text": "Uh, call dice and goomer. They'll help you! Great!"
    },
    {
      "start": 764.449,
      "end": 767.25,
      "text": "- Sam! - Gotta go. Bye!"
    },
    {
      "start": 767.251,
      "end": 769.098,
      "text": "♪ Spaceships!"
    },
    {
      "start": 769.099,
      "end": 771.559,
      "text": "♪ Spaceships!"
    },
    {
      "start": 772.155,
      "end": 773.838,
      "text": "Perfect, peezy. Let's take a break."
    },
    {
      "start": 773.839,
      "end": 776.176,
      "text": "Ha ha! Yeah it was perfect!"
    },
    {
      "start": 776.177,
      "end": 777.693,
      "text": "Peezy perfect!"
    },
    {
      "start": 777.694,
      "end": 779.614,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 781.599,
      "end": 783.366,
      "text": "- That was hot. - Yeah! So what y'all think?"
    },
    {
      "start": 783.367,
      "end": 785.068,
      "text": "Off the chain! Off the chain, peezy!"
    },
    {
      "start": 785.069,
      "end": 787.358,
      "text": "- I'm a genius! - You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "start": 787.359,
      "end": 788.637,
      "text": "You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "start": 788.638,
      "end": 791.34,
      "text": "Yeah. Yo Scotty, Jon-jerale!"
    },
    {
      "start": 791.341,
      "end": 793.971,
      "text": "- Yeah, I got you, peez. - Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 793.972,
      "end": 796.432,
      "text": "So Puckett..."
    },
    {
      "start": 797.072,
      "end": 799.115,
      "text": "What'd you think of my song-song?"
    },
    {
      "start": 799.116,
      "end": 800.649,
      "text": "Eh, it was all right."
    },
    {
      "start": 800.65,
      "end": 803.05,
      "text": "Yeah. What?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 803.186,
      "end": 807.423,
      "text": "Uh, ya know, the chorus. The chorus is a little weak."
    },
    {
      "start": 807.424,
      "end": 811.194,
      "text": "You should add some sound-effects."
    },
    {
      "start": 811.195,
      "end": 813.029,
      "text": "What kind of sound effects?"
    },
    {
      "start": 813.03,
      "end": 816.39,
      "text": "I don't know. Maybe a camel screaming."
    },
    {
      "start": 816.391,
      "end": 819.211,
      "text": "A screaming camel?"
    },
    {
      "start": 822.031,
      "end": 824.371,
      "text": "I love it!"
    },
    {
      "start": 824.551,
      "end": 826.552,
      "text": "Camel screaming, that's genius."
    },
    {
      "start": 826.553,
      "end": 829.958,
      "text": "- Puckett! - Hey, I think outside the hump."
    },
    {
      "start": 829.959,
      "end": 832.706,
      "text": "Yo peezy, can I eat my hamburger now?"
    },
    {
      "start": 832.707,
      "end": 836.254,
      "text": "I don't care what you do, bunny!"
    },
    {
      "start": 836.255,
      "end": 839.778,
      "text": "All right, you freaks, my friend cat needs me so I'm gonna go head back home..."
    },
    {
      "start": 839.779,
      "end": 841.636,
      "text": "Hey, hey, no no no!"
    },
    {
      "start": 841.637,
      "end": 845.442,
      "text": "You gotta help me with my fishes. Come right here."
    },
    {
      "start": 845.443,
      "end": 848.066,
      "text": "See these? These are piranha fish."
    },
    {
      "start": 848.067,
      "end": 850.899,
      "text": "Okay. And this is my pretending-to-care face."
    },
    {
      "start": 854.84,
      "end": 860.74,
      "text": "Look, I got four piranha fish, and kanye just tweeted that he's got five."
    },
    {
      "start": 860.751,
      "end": 862.565,
      "text": "Get to the point, peezy."
    },
    {
      "start": 862.566,
      "end": 867.319,
      "text": "I need you to go get me two piranha fish, so I can have more than kanye."
    },
    {
      "start": 867.32,
      "end": 869.264,
      "text": "Dude, it's already after eight."
    },
    {
      "start": 869.265,
      "end": 871.789,
      "text": "Then I guess you better curry up then."
    },
    {
      "start": 871.79,
      "end": 875.21,
      "text": "Yeah. You better curry up."
    },
    {
      "start": 886.767,
      "end": 888.835,
      "text": "She threw your hamburger in the fish tank!"
    },
    {
      "start": 888.836,
      "end": 890.777,
      "text": "Knock knock. Who's there?"
    },
    {
      "start": 890.778,
      "end": 893.246,
      "text": "Not your hamburger!"
    },
    {
      "start": 893.247,
      "end": 894.802,
      "text": "I'm a genius!"
    },
    {
      "start": 894.803,
      "end": 898.883,
      "text": "- You a genius. - You're a genius."
    },
    {
      "start": 900.747,
      "end": 901.841,
      "text": "Oh..."
    },
    {
      "start": 901.842,
      "end": 903.732,
      "text": "Whoa, what mess."
    },
    {
      "start": 903.733,
      "end": 905.713,
      "text": "Hello?"
    },
    {
      "start": 905.94,
      "end": 907.126,
      "text": "Cat?"
    },
    {
      "start": 907.127,
      "end": 908.987,
      "text": "Cat?"
    },
    {
      "start": 909.913,
      "end": 911.773,
      "text": "Cat!"
    },
    {
      "start": 914.459,
      "end": 916.859,
      "text": "Little help?"
    },
    {
      "start": 917.102,
      "end": 918.662,
      "text": "- Whoa! - My goodness!"
    },
    {
      "start": 918.663,
      "end": 919.538,
      "text": "Oi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 919.539,
      "end": 922.059,
      "text": "What happened?"
    },
    {
      "start": 922.082,
      "end": 923.842,
      "text": "Oh, wait!"
    },
    {
      "start": 923.843,
      "end": 926.845,
      "text": "Let's make sure it's really cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 926.846,
      "end": 928.706,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": 929.127,
      "end": 930.755,
      "text": "Ow!"
    },
    {
      "start": 930.756,
      "end": 932.285,
      "text": "Oi!"
    },
    {
      "start": 932.286,
      "end": 935.106,
      "text": "Yeah, that's her."
    },
    {
      "start": 935.373,
      "end": 937.173,
      "text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "start": 937.227,
      "end": 942.281,
      "text": "Oh, I can breathe, which is so much better than not being able to breathe."
    },
    {
      "start": 942.282,
      "end": 943.997,
      "text": "Who did this to you?"
    },
    {
      "start": 943.998,
      "end": 947.166,
      "text": "These little boys i'm babysitting, Steven and Billy."
    },
    {
      "start": 947.167,
      "end": 948.994,
      "text": "Well, don't you worry."
    },
    {
      "start": 948.995,
      "end": 951.205,
      "text": "Yeah, we're here to help you with whatever you need."
    },
    {
      "start": 951.206,
      "end": 952.907,
      "text": "Oh, thank you."
    },
    {
      "start": 952.908,
      "end": 955.485,
      "text": "So can somebody please remove me from this broom?"
    },
    {
      "start": 955.486,
      "end": 957.922,
      "text": "Oh, sure just turn around."
    },
    {
      "start": 957.923,
      "end": 960.383,
      "text": "Oh, one sec."
    },
    {
      "start": 961.437,
      "end": 962.922,
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": 962.923,
      "end": 964.09,
      "text": "Whoa!"
    },
    {
      "start": 964.091,
      "end": 965.822,
      "text": "Ooh!"
    },
    {
      "start": 965.823,
      "end": 968.29,
      "text": "He said whoa twice!"
    },
    {
      "start": 968.291,
      "end": 970.506,
      "text": "So, if you could just get this broom off of me."
    },
    {
      "start": 970.507,
      "end": 972.17,
      "text": "Goomer, goomer, check this out!"
    },
    {
      "start": 972.171,
      "end": 974.331,
      "text": "A phone!"
    },
    {
      "start": 974.567,
      "end": 976.8,
      "text": "No! The text from Sam!"
    },
    {
      "start": 976.801,
      "end": 979.801,
      "text": "My arms are hurting."
    },
    {
      "start": 979.804,
      "end": 981.738,
      "text": "She says, I'm here in the parking lot..."
    },
    {
      "start": 981.739,
      "end": 983.373,
      "text": "Yay, Sam's home."
    },
    {
      "start": 983.374,
      "end": 985.041,
      "text": "Peezy b wants two piranha fish."
    },
    {
      "start": 985.042,
      "end": 987.317,
      "text": "Where do I get them, and can goomer give me a ride?"
    },
    {
      "start": 987.318,
      "end": 990.177,
      "text": "We get to help Sam do something for peezy b?"
    },
    {
      "start": 990.178,
      "end": 992.548,
      "text": "Yeah! And I know a place that sells piranhas!"
    },
    {
      "start": 992.549,
      "end": 994.583,
      "text": "And I know how to drive a car!"
    },
    {
      "start": 994.584,
      "end": 995.851,
      "text": "Hey fellas..."
    },
    {
      "start": 995.852,
      "end": 998.154,
      "text": "Come on, let's go!"
    },
    {
      "start": 998.155,
      "end": 1000.256,
      "text": "Wait! I still need help!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1000.257,
      "end": 1003.137,
      "text": "I'm on the... ah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1004.083,
      "end": 1007.383,
      "text": "Aah! That's all I need."
    },
    {
      "start": 1015.815,
      "end": 1017.675,
      "text": "Cat?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1017.953,
      "end": 1020.233,
      "text": "Oh. Hello."
    },
    {
      "start": 1020.762,
      "end": 1024.694,
      "text": "Look, I know you're mad at me, and I don't even blame you, but..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1024.695,
      "end": 1026.991,
      "text": "Peezy b really needed me to get him some piranha fish..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1026.992,
      "end": 1029.332,
      "text": "It's fine."
    },
    {
      "start": 1030.653,
      "end": 1032.12,
      "text": "It's fine?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1032.121,
      "end": 1035.022,
      "text": "There's a chicken in the fridge if you're hungry."
    },
    {
      "start": 1035.023,
      "end": 1038.778,
      "text": "- You made me a chicken? - Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 1038.779,
      "end": 1041.944,
      "text": "It was ready five hours ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 1041.945,
      "end": 1045.602,
      "text": "You can heat it up in the microwave if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "start": 1045.603,
      "end": 1047.303,
      "text": "Well, where are the kids we're babysitting?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1047.304,
      "end": 1049.458,
      "text": "- Did their parents come pick them up? - No."
    },
    {
      "start": 1049.459,
      "end": 1050.939,
      "text": "Then where are they?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1050.94,
      "end": 1052.607,
      "text": "Okay. We're all good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1052.608,
      "end": 1054.91,
      "text": "The boys are in the back, watching a movie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1054.911,
      "end": 1057.68,
      "text": "Oh, thank you so much, mindy."
    },
    {
      "start": 1057.681,
      "end": 1059.748,
      "text": "Sure. Can I get you some hot tea?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1059.749,
      "end": 1062.241,
      "text": "Oh, well, if it's not too much trouble."
    },
    {
      "start": 1062.242,
      "end": 1066.742,
      "text": "Oh don't be silly, it's already brewing."
    },
    {
      "start": 1067.992,
      "end": 1070.066,
      "text": "What... who is she?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1070.067,
      "end": 1072.662,
      "text": "Oh, that's my friend, mindy."
    },
    {
      "start": 1072.663,
      "end": 1073.73,
      "text": "Mindy?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1073.731,
      "end": 1076.2,
      "text": "Yup. And she's a terrific babysitter."
    },
    {
      "start": 1076.201,
      "end": 1080.254,
      "text": "When I told her I needed help, she came right over."
    },
    {
      "start": 1080.255,
      "end": 1082.715,
      "text": "I love kids."
    },
    {
      "start": 1082.727,
      "end": 1084.071,
      "text": "Here's your tea."
    },
    {
      "start": 1084.072,
      "end": 1086.308,
      "text": "You are so sweet."
    },
    {
      "start": 1086.309,
      "end": 1090.149,
      "text": "I'm gonna get you some cookies."
    },
    {
      "start": 1092.549,
      "end": 1094.247,
      "text": "I do not believe this!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1094.248,
      "end": 1097.387,
      "text": "I'm sorry, what's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1097.388,
      "end": 1101.391,
      "text": "You're here babysitting with another girl!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1101.392,
      "end": 1103.992,
      "text": "Well, you're never home!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1103.993,
      "end": 1107.662,
      "text": "Yeah. Because I've been at work. Working my butt off all day and night!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1107.663,
      "end": 1110.46,
      "text": "And then I just... I come home to find you here with another girl?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1110.461,
      "end": 1112.751,
      "text": "Well, what did you expect?!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1112.752,
      "end": 1115.092,
      "text": "You work all the time and I have needs!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1115.093,
      "end": 1116.953,
      "text": "Ugh."
    },
    {
      "start": 1117.15,
      "end": 1120.701,
      "text": "You think it's easy for me, babysitting all by myself?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1120.702,
      "end": 1125.179,
      "text": "When you're out with your musician friends 'til all hours of the night?! Please!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1125.18,
      "end": 1128.33,
      "text": "And then you just waltz in here as you please,"
    },
    {
      "start": 1128.331,
      "end": 1131.661,
      "text": "with your breath smelling of Jon-jerale!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1131.662,
      "end": 1135.034,
      "text": "You get that chick out of here!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1135.035,
      "end": 1137.493,
      "text": "No. I don't think I will."
    },
    {
      "start": 1137.494,
      "end": 1140.463,
      "text": "All right then. Hey mindy..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1140.464,
      "end": 1142.252,
      "text": "- Hi! - Let me see your elbow."
    },
    {
      "start": 1142.253,
      "end": 1144.489,
      "text": "Oh, sure. Why do you wanna see my elbow?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1144.49,
      "end": 1146.896,
      "text": "- Good night mindy. - It's not my bedtime."
    },
    {
      "start": 1146.897,
      "end": 1148.757,
      "text": "Woo."
    },
    {
      "start": 1150.829,
      "end": 1154.669,
      "text": "You made mindy go non-conscious!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1154.999,
      "end": 1159.019,
      "text": "Oh no! Now who will bring us tea?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1161.492,
      "end": 1163.306,
      "text": "Geez. Don't start crying."
    },
    {
      "start": 1163.307,
      "end": 1165.303,
      "text": "I can't help it."
    },
    {
      "start": 1167.084,
      "end": 1169.004,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1169.113,
      "end": 1171.281,
      "text": "Puckett, let's roll!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1171.282,
      "end": 1173.208,
      "text": "Aah! He's here!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1174.585,
      "end": 1177.744,
      "text": "Look, it's the little red-haired girl that dances like a squirrel."
    },
    {
      "start": 1180.324,
      "end": 1182.158,
      "text": "Peezy, it's late, what are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1182.159,
      "end": 1185.027,
      "text": "I came to get you so we can go to acapulco!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1185.028,
      "end": 1186.195,
      "text": "What? Why?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1186.196,
      "end": 1189.865,
      "text": "So I can get this crazy animal!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1189.866,
      "end": 1191.567,
      "text": "It's a tree biscuit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1191.568,
      "end": 1193.236,
      "text": "And he lives in acapulco."
    },
    {
      "start": 1193.237,
      "end": 1197.017,
      "text": "I gotta get me a tree biscuit!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1197.14,
      "end": 1198.94,
      "text": "Go."
    },
    {
      "start": 1199.24,
      "end": 1202.42,
      "text": "Go to puck-a-doo-PLO."
    },
    {
      "start": 1203.811,
      "end": 1205.731,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 1207.126,
      "end": 1208.465,
      "text": "I quit."
    },
    {
      "start": 1208.466,
      "end": 1210.552,
      "text": "What? What'd she just say to me?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1210.553,
      "end": 1213.577,
      "text": "Look look look. Nobody quits on me, okay?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1213.578,
      "end": 1216.218,
      "text": "I quit on you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1216.26,
      "end": 1218.54,
      "text": "Okay, bye."
    },
    {
      "start": 1219.34,
      "end": 1221.331,
      "text": "Don't do that to me, Puckett!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1221.332,
      "end": 1225.335,
      "text": "Oh! You're the best assistant I ever had! Please!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1225.336,
      "end": 1226.67,
      "text": "You got bunny."
    },
    {
      "start": 1226.671,
      "end": 1229.731,
      "text": "Oh, bunny's no good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1230.308,
      "end": 1233.368,
      "text": "Dang peez, that hurt."
    },
    {
      "start": 1234.212,
      "end": 1236.046,
      "text": "Look, I'll find you a new assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 1236.047,
      "end": 1238.749,
      "text": "Where you going to find me a new assistant, huh? Where?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1238.75,
      "end": 1240.324,
      "text": "Um..."
    },
    {
      "start": 1240.325,
      "end": 1243.454,
      "text": "My friend mindy makes really good tea."
    },
    {
      "start": 1243.455,
      "end": 1245.315,
      "text": "Tea?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1245.69,
      "end": 1248.342,
      "text": "I hear tea tastes good."
    },
    {
      "start": 1248.343,
      "end": 1252.796,
      "text": "Well, mindy is right over there, on the floor."
    },
    {
      "start": 1252.797,
      "end": 1254.598,
      "text": "Bunny, go get my new assistant."
    },
    {
      "start": 1254.599,
      "end": 1257.839,
      "text": "- Okay, peez. - Mm hmm."
    },
    {
      "start": 1260.341,
      "end": 1261.872,
      "text": "Are you peezy b?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1261.873,
      "end": 1264.453,
      "text": "- Yeah. - Aah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1271.65,
      "end": 1273.951,
      "text": "- What the... - Where we going?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1273.952,
      "end": 1275.611,
      "text": "To acapulco!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1275.612,
      "end": 1277.355,
      "text": "Okay, sorry."
    },
    {
      "start": 1277.356,
      "end": 1282.696,
      "text": "Oh, bunny, you upset me in ways I can't understand!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1292.42,
      "end": 1295.18,
      "text": "You like my hat."
    },
    {
      "start": 1295.44,
      "end": 1297.143,
      "text": "It's an okay hat."
    },
    {
      "start": 1297.144,
      "end": 1299.543,
      "text": "The movie's over! Let's break some more plates!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1299.544,
      "end": 1302.389,
      "text": "- Yeah! Woo hoo! - Yeah!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1302.39,
      "end": 1305.849,
      "text": "Boys, boys, boys, inside voices, please."
    },
    {
      "start": 1305.85,
      "end": 1308.31,
      "text": "Hey, let me."
    },
    {
      "start": 1308.959,
      "end": 1311.221,
      "text": "Uh, you guys wanna play a little game?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1311.222,
      "end": 1312.723,
      "text": "- Yeah. - Okay."
    },
    {
      "start": 1312.724,
      "end": 1314.726,
      "text": "- Let me see your elbows. - Sure!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1314.727,
      "end": 1317.009,
      "text": "Now say goodnight to cat."
    },
    {
      "start": 1317.01,
      "end": 1319.41,
      "text": "- Oh! - Ow!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1320.131,
      "end": 1322.231,
      "text": "I missed you."
    },
    {
      "start": 1322.232,
      "end": 1323.788,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "start": 1323.789,
      "end": 1328.769,
      "text": "Now why don't you go heat me up some chicken."
    },
    {
      "start": 1330.297,
      "end": 1332.643,
      "text": "♪ Uh you're living a lie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1332.644,
      "end": 1334.577,
      "text": "♪ No rib in the sky."
    },
    {
      "start": 1334.578,
      "end": 1336.575,
      "text": "♪ No love in the air."
    },
    {
      "start": 1336.576,
      "end": 1339.945,
      "text": "♪ Rib in the sky, peezy stare!"
    },
    {
      "start": 1339.946,
      "end": 1341.78,
      "text": "♪ You living the lie."
    },
    {
      "start": 1341.781,
      "end": 1343.115,
      "text": "♪ The Karma, the drama your mama."
    },
    {
      "start": 1343.116,
      "end": 1345.684,
      "text": "♪ The time that I seen them llamas."
    },
    {
      "start": 1345.685,
      "end": 1349.105,
      "text": "♪ Y'all seen them llamas?"
    }
  ]
}